# Insight Flow — core rules

Read `CLAUDE.md` (repo rules), `docs/handoff-dev2.md` (Developer 2 areas, contracts, how-tos) and
`docs/prompts/02-developer2.md` (Developer 2 master prompt and milestones) before non-trivial work.

## Ownership
- Developer 2 owns `src/InsightFlow.Web`, `src/InsightFlow.Api`, `src/InsightFlow.Connectors` and `src/InsightFlow.Worker`.
- Roy owns Domain, Contracts, Persistence, Query/QueryService, Agents/AgentService, AppHost, ServiceDefaults,
  evals, architecture tests and `Directory.*.props`. Propose changes there; never make them silently.

## Process
- Plan before large edits. Verify package versions and API signatures; never guess.
- Package versions belong only in `Directory.Packages.props`.
- Done = `dotnet build InsightFlow.slnx` with zero warnings, plus green tests (`dotnet test --solution InsightFlow.slnx`).
  New endpoints get integration tests with a cross-tenant check; UI changes are checked in a browser.
- Never commit, push, deploy, provision Azure resources, delete data or edit secrets unless the developer explicitly
  asks for that action. Show `git diff --stat` before a commit. Conventional Commits.

## Never
- No Python. No secrets in the repo. No row data, data-bearing prompts or credentials in logs.
- Never take the tenant from a request body or route; use `ITenantContext` / `ICurrentTenant`.
  Tenant-owned data implements `ITenantOwned`.
- No role strings in endpoints; use `InsightFlowPolicies`.
- AI-generated SQL runs only through `ISqlSandbox`. Column names never come from user or model text.
- Credentials only as a `SecretReference` via `ISecretStore`.
- Web references only Contracts + ServiceDefaults (and `InsightFlow.Domain.Viz`). No UI/JS outside Web, no CDN
  scripts, no Telerik (the UI is Tailwind + Apache ECharts).
- Services never run EF migrations; only the migration service does.

## C# conventions
- File-scoped namespaces, `sealed` by default, records for immutable data.
- `CancellationToken` passed everywhere; no `.Result`/`.Wait()`.
- `[LoggerMessage]` logging. Minimal APIs with `TypedResults` + ProblemDetails.
- Options validated on start. New DTOs added to `ContractsJsonContext`.
- Tests: xUnit v3, Shouldly, `Method_State_Expected`; golden files via `tests/InsightFlow.Testing/Golden.cs`.
